#: src/features/Case/data/frontend-senior/demoSnippetSection.ts:29
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"For a senior-level interview, you should go beyond 'components + global "
"store'. Talk about module boundaries (feature-based folders, domain-driven "
"slices), isolated design systems, clear contracts between API and UI, and "
"how you avoid tight coupling. Mention decisions around routing, "
"data-fetching strategy (for example React Query or SWR), error handling, "
"and how you'd support gradual refactors or micro-frontend approaches. This "
"shows you think like an architect, not just an implementer."
msgstr ""
"Untuk wawancara tingkat senior, Anda harus melampaui 'komponen + "
"penyimpanan global'. Bicarakan tentang batasan modul (folder berbasis "
"fitur, potongan berbasis domain), sistem desain yang terisolasi, kontrak "
"yang jelas antara API dan UI, dan bagaimana Anda menghindari keterkaitan "
"yang erat. Sebutkan keputusan seputar pengaturan rute, strategi pengambilan "
"data (misalnya React Query atau SWR), penanganan kesalahan, dan bagaimana "
"Anda mendukung pengubahan bertahap atau pendekatan mikro-frontend. Ini "
"menunjukkan bahwa Anda berpikir seperti seorang arsitek, bukan hanya "
"pelaksana."

