#: src/features/RolePlay/rolePlayData.tsx:747
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Get comfortable purchasing travel tickets in a bustling train station "
"scenario. Perfect for practicing how to ask about routes, departure times, "
"and ticket types.\n"
"\n"
"## Why You Should Play *Buying a Train Ticket*\n"
"1. Gain confidence asking about schedules, prices, and possible discounts.  "
"\n"
"2. Learn essential travel vocabulary, including ticket options and train "
"routes.  \n"
"3. Practice navigating public transportation systems in a realistic "
"setting.  \n"
"4. Become better at clarifying details and handling unexpected changes.  \n"
"5. Build the practical language skills you need for smooth, stress-free "
"travel.\n"
"\n"
"## How the Scenario Works\n"
"In this scenario, you’ll step into the role of a traveler looking to buy a "
"ticket. The AI takes on the role of a train station ticket agent, asking "
"you where you’re headed, when you’re departing, and what type of ticket you "
"need. By interacting with the AI, you’ll master the art of asking the right "
"questions and understanding key information about your journey.\n"
msgstr ""
"Get comfortable purchasing travel tickets in a bustling train station "
"scenario. Perfect for practicing how to ask about routes, departure times, "
"and ticket types.\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa Anda Harus Bermain *Membeli Tiket Kereta*\n"
"1. Dapatkan kepercayaan diri untuk bertanya tentang jadwal, harga, dan "
"kemungkinan diskon.  \n"
"2. Pelajari kosa kata perjalanan yang penting, termasuk pilihan tiket dan "
"rute kereta.  \n"
"3. Latih kemampuan untuk menavigasi sistem transportasi umum dalam "
"pengaturan yang realistis.  \n"
"4. Menjadi lebih baik dalam menjelaskan detail dan menangani perubahan yang "
"tidak terduga.  \n"
"5. Bangun keterampilan bahasa praktis yang Anda butuhkan untuk perjalanan "
"yang lancar dan bebas stres.\n"
"\n"
"## Cara Kerja Skenario Ini\n"
"Dalam skenario ini, Anda akan berperan sebagai seorang pelancong yang ingin "
"membeli tiket. AI mengambil peran sebagai petugas tiket stasiun kereta, "
"menanyakan kemana Anda pergi, kapan Anda berangkat, dan jenis tiket apa "
"yang Anda butuhkan. Dengan berinteraksi dengan AI, Anda akan menguasai seni "
"bertanya dengan benar dan memahami informasi penting tentang perjalanan "
"Anda."

#: src/features/RolePlay/rolePlayData.tsx:903
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Get comfortable shopping in a real store setting by asking questions about "
"product locations, prices, and deals. Perfect for building confidence in "
"navigating aisles, comparing items, and checking out.\n"
"\n"
"#### Why You Should Play *At the Grocery Store*\n"
"1. Practice finding specific items on your shopping list.  \n"
"2. Learn to ask questions about prices, promotions, and product details.  \n"
"3. Explore how to handle polite small talk with store employees.  \n"
"4. Improve your communication when making quick decisions or comparing "
"options.  \n"
"5. Gain valuable experience in a common, everyday scenario.\n"
"\n"
"#### How the Scenario Works\n"
"You’ll take the role of a customer shopping for groceries. The AI, as a "
"store employee, will ask what you’re looking for, suggest deals, and guide "
"you to the right products. This interactive role-play simulates a realistic "
"shopping experience, helping you build essential communication skills.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dapatkan kenyamanan berbelanja di pengaturan toko yang sebenarnya dengan "
"mengajukan pertanyaan tentang lokasi produk, harga, dan penawaran. Sempurna "
"untuk membangun kepercayaan diri dalam menjelajahi lorong, membandingkan "
"barang, dan melakukan pembayaran.\n"
"\n"
"#### Kenapa Anda Harus Bermain *Di Toko Grosir*\n"
"1. Berlatih menemukan barang-barang spesifik dalam daftar belanja Anda.  \n"
"2. Belajar mengajukan pertanyaan tentang harga, promosi, dan detail produk. "
" \n"
"3. Jelajahi cara menangani obrolan kecil yang sopan dengan karyawan toko.  \n"
"4. Tingkatkan komunikasi Anda saat membuat keputusan cepat atau "
"membandingkan opsi.  \n"
"5. Dapatkan pengalaman berharga dalam skenario sehari-hari yang umum.\n"
"\n"
"#### Bagaimana Skenario Ini Bekerja\n"
"Anda akan mengambil peran sebagai pelanggan yang berbelanja bahan makanan. "
"AI, sebagai karyawan toko, akan bertanya apa yang Anda cari, memberi saran "
"tentang penawaran, dan membimbing Anda ke produk yang tepat. Peran "
"interaktif ini mensimulasikan pengalaman berbelanja yang realistis, "
"membantu Anda membangun keterampilan komunikasi yang penting."

